          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye imwe mukoba muti, ‘Musengwa Katonda mu nkola ye tasala nsonga mu butuufu.’ Aye muwulire imwe ab'eighanga Isiraeli: Obwo bwenebwene nze mu nkola yange tisala nsonga mu butuufu? Nti katyo niimwe mutasala nsonga mu butuufu mu nkola dhaimwe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu omutuufu bw'akyuka n'alekera okukola ebituufu, naakola ebibi, alifa olw'ebibi by'akola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye omwonooni bw'akyuka n'alekera okukola ebibi, n'akola ebituufu ebigwaniire ng'ajiira ku mateeka, aliwonia obulamu bwe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuba olwo aba yeefumintiriiza yaakyuka, yaalekera okukola ebibi byonabyona bye yakola. Bwenebwene talifa, aliba mulamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye imwe ab'eighanga Isiraeli mukoba muti, ‘Musengwa Katonda mu nkola ye tasala nsonga mu butuufu.’ Ee, imwe Abaisiraeli, obwo bwenebwene nze mu nkola yange tisala nsonga mu butuufu? Nti katyo niimwe mutasala nsonga mu butuufu mu nkola dhaimwe!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
