          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nze Musengwa Katonda ndi kubakobera imwe Abaisiraeli, nti ndisalira buli muntu ku imwe omusango nga njiira ku bikolwa bye. Mwenenie mukyuke muve mu bibi byaimwe byonabyona, olwo ebibi byaimwe ebyo lwe bitaabaviiremu kuzikirira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwetooleku ebibi byonabyona bye mubairenga mukola, mufune emyoyo emiyaaka n'endowooza empyaka. Imwe abantu b'eighanga Isiraeli, lwaki mwenda okufa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
