                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nze tinhumirwa kubona muntu yeenayeena ng'afiire. Kale ni mukyuke muve mu bibi byaimwe, memale mube balamu.” Musengwa Katonda atyo bw'akobye.",
          "type": "text",
